## E2E data strategy

```ts
// Playwright fixture: create user via API, not UI
export const test = base.extend<{ user: User }>({
  user: async ({ request }, use) => {
    const res = await request.post('/api/test/users', { data: buildUser() });
    const user = await res.json();
    await use(user);
    await request.delete(`/api/test/users/${user.id}`);
  },
});
```

Expose test-only endpoints only in non-production environments and protect them.

