## Third parties

Use provider sandboxes or stubs; record outbound webhooks; contract-test boundaries.

## Common mistakes

- One shared test account used by every parallel worker.
- UI-driven setup for every test, making suites slow.
- Tests depending on production-like data that drifts.
- Real customer data in test databases.
